==Battleground==
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~20 seconds<sup>60f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Since Metal Hippoe only takes 1 damage per hit, cats with rapid attack rates are optimal. Simply spam fast attackers such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]], [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] and [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener Cat]] until completion. [[Critical Hit]]s can help, but are not essential for this stage.

A super quick way to beat this stage is by using quick-hitting cats/[[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]], and cats with super high damage. First, send out your fast hitters/Critical Hitters, and let them destroy the Metal Hippoes. Then, once the enemy base is at around 550,000 health, send out your heavy hitters to annihilate the base.

