*Love, Metal Hippoe's name in Japanese is "Koi no Metakaba" ("Love of Metal Hippo"), a reference to the song "[https://youtu.be/upANnmMD_J8 Koi no Megaraba]" ("Love of Mega Lover") by [[wikipedia:Maximum the Hormone|Maximum the Hormone]].
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] the stage gives one Rare Ticket instead of a Normal Ticket.
**The cost of Energy on this stage is reduced by 40%, making it so it costs 150 Energy instead of 250.
**When viewing Stage Info, it also says Rare Ticket Chance! rather than Cat Ticket Chance!

